mentOfSecurities contextRef="MainD" unitRef="INR" decimals="0">2780382320</in-capmkt:PaidUpShareCapitalPostAllotmentOfSecurities><in-capmkt:NumberOfSharesPaidUpPostAllotmentOfSecurities contextRef="MainD" unitRef="shares" decimals="INF">1390191160</in-capmkt:NumberOfSharesPaidUpPostAllotmentOfSecurities><in-capmkt:AnyOtherInformationRelatedToAllotmentOfSecurities contextRef="MainI">The Debenture Allotment Committee have approved the allotment of 125,000 Secured, Rated, Listed Redeemable Non-convertible Debentures (“NCDs”) of the face value of Rs. 1,00,000 per debenture, issued at par, aggregating to subscription amount of Rs. 1250,00,00,000 (Indian Rupees One Thousand Two Hundred Fifty Crore Only) on private placement basis to the identified investors. The same includes Base issue size of Rs. 1000 Crore plus Green shoe subscription of Rs. 250 Crore aggregating to Rs. 1250 Crore. The said NCDs have been issued at a Fixed Coupon of 7.95% p.a. and are proposed to be listed on the Wholesale Debt Market Segment of BSE Limited.Since tabs for providing details of allotment of non-convertible securities is not available in the XBRL, the details are provided in the Notes.</in-capmkt:AnyOtherInformationRelatedToAllotmentOfSecurities><in-capmkt:RemarksWebsiteDisseminationForAllotmentOfSecurities contextRef="MainI">The Debenture Allotment Committee have approved the allotment of 125,000 Secured, Rated, Listed Redeemable Non-convertible Debentures (“NCDs”) of the face value of Rs. 1,00,000 per debenture, issued at par, aggregating to subscription amount of Rs. 1250,00,00,000 (Indian Rupees One Thousand Two Hundred Fifty Crore Only) on private placement basis to the identified investors. The same includes Base issue size of Rs. 1000 Crore plus Green shoe subscription of Rs. 250 Crore aggregating to Rs. 1250 Crore. The said NCDs have been issued at a Fixed Coupon of 7.95% p.a. and are proposed to be listed on the Wholesale Debt Market Segment of BSE Limited.</in-capmkt:RemarksWebsiteDisseminationForAllotmentOfSecurities></xbrli:xbrl>
